changed is derived by code afterwards; the evidence in view stays D198's; judging-v7 unchanged | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1073:| D729 | 2026-11-22 | judging-v13 $0 gate passes (council 46ad): 87/87 under three hash seeds, 47/47 mutants, one stored family rendered and checked; next: the paid gate's sender and packets at $0 through the council, then Alex's ceiling (36 calls, ~$0.2–0.4) | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/GATE-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1074:| D730 | 2026-11-22 | Alex: build the paid gate's sender and blind packets at $0, rehearse, council, then ask for the ceiling (\"接着搭，搭好再问上限 (推荐)\") | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1075:| D731 | 2026-11-22 | judging-v13 paid-gate harness ready (council 47h): first attempt scored on both arms, retries diagnostic; packets hold the scored answers only and commit to their mapping; one-to-one reconciliation; sealed readings, one verdict; rehearsal 63/63, mutants 33/33; 36 first attempts ~$0.17 (≤$0.39); next: Alex names the ceiling (proposed $0.50) | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1076:| D732 | 2026-11-22 | Alex: the paid gate's ceiling is $0.50 (\"0.5 美元 (推荐)\"); sent once from an empty folder, detached | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1077:| D733 | 2026-11-22 | judging-v13 paid gate STOP: all 72 answers refused ($0.37 of $0.50), 0 of 90 outcomes named a figure; the format's rules lived in the check, not the request (7 field descriptions), and some checks refuse right answers; process error: the $0 answer was written knowing the check; council 48: bounded repair + a $0 blind conformance test, or close v13 — Alex's choice | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1078:| D734 | 2026-11-22 | Alex: one bounded repair of judging-v13's request and checks, then a registered $0 blind conformance test (\"修一次再零成本盲测 (推荐)\"); a clean result returns to him for a re-send of the same 36 requests | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3711:## D355 · 2026-11-04 · The filing topic closes without a change: filing is about 85% right; the remaining misses are recorded as known defects\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3951:  extraction-ruler bullet joined §7.1; \"own the loop\" now reads with \"a run starts only on his word\" and D355's stop rule; §11 says how a\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:4438:  the result goes to him before anything else (D355).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:4780:  planted controls and count, and the result goes to him. A result that contradicts the plan stops the line (D355). Every\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:10957:## D725 · 2026-11-22 · Council round 45/45b: the number answers fail because related numbers have no shared, checked calculation; one judge version and one test recommended to Alex\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:10991:## D726 · 2026-11-22 · Alex opens a judge version for related number questions ($0 gate first) and agrees to \"Forecast unavailable\" as the first-release interim\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:10993:- **The questions** (after D725):\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11001:  - A new judge version is opened for the bounded test of D725: related number questions judged together, with labelled figures and\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11008:## D727 · 2026-11-22 · judging-v13's $0 gate: the design passed council (round 46e); gate runs 1–6 and council rounds 46f–46j; the gate is not yet passed; one choice goes to Alex\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11041:## D728 · 2026-11-22 · Alex: the family judge does not see its earlier forecasts while calculating\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11043:- **The question** (after D727): \"新判官算数的时候，要不要让它看到自己上一次的预测？… 不给看的代价：以前靠'上次结论'带着的那些老证据（这次没展示的）就丢了，只剩最近被引用过的和新到的证据。\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11055:## D729 · 2026-11-22 · judging-v13's $0 gate passes (council round 46ad); the paid gate needs its harness built at $0 and Alex's ceiling\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11067:- **Not shown:** how a model uses the format (the paid gate, D725), production lifecycle, the product request builder.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11073:## D730 · 2026-11-22 · Alex: build the paid gate's harness at $0, then ask for the ceiling\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11075:- **The question** (after D729): \"要不要现在接着搭花钱测试用的发送程序和盲审材料？搭的过程不花钱，搭好、演练、过 council 之后再问你上限（预计 36 次调用，0.2–0.4 美元）。\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11080:- **Decided (Alex):** the sender and the blind reading packets for D725's paid gate are built, rehearsed at $0 and reviewed by the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11083:## D731 · 2026-11-22 · judging-v13's paid-gate harness is ready to send (council round 47h); the first attempt is scored on both arms; the ceiling is Alex's\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11085:- **What was built (D730):** `research/2026-11-22-number-answers/paid_gate.py` (plan, send, recover, packets, verdict, replay),\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11090:- **Decided by the council (D725's lines unchanged):**\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11091:  - The first attempt is scored on both arms. D725 registers the arms \"under the same format and checks\" and says nothing about\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11110:## D732 · 2026-11-22 · Alex: the paid gate's ceiling is $0.50\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11112:- **The question** (after D731): \"judging-v13 花钱那一关（36 次计分请求，按公开价格约 0.17 美元，最坏 0.39 美元；重试排在最后、只作诊断）已经过理事会，现在可以发。你给多少上限？\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11122:## D733 · 2026-11-22 · judging-v13's paid gate: STOP, every answer refused; the format's rules were never stated in the request (council round 48); repair or close is Alex's choice\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11124:- **What ran** (D732): 36 scored first attempts and 36 diagnostic retries, gpt-6-luna, $0.3677 of $0.50 (ledger: 72 attempts,\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11126:- **Registered result (D725's lines, scored as written, D680):** all 72 answers refused by `calc_check.py`, none published; the joint\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11129:- **What it measures:** not D725's question (whether one call over a family gives better numbers), only that the answer format, as\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11163:    - Only then is a re-send of the same 36 requests asked for, under a new decision with D725's lines unchanged.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11169:## D734 · 2026-11-22 · Alex: repair judging-v13's request and checks once, then a $0 blind conformance test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11171:- **The question** (after D733): \"判数字的新版本（一次判一组相关的数）花钱那一关没过：72 个答案全被挡在“填格式”这一步。原因是填写规则只写在检查代码里、没写进给模型的说明，而且检查代码自己也会把对的判错。这没回答“一起判会不会更准”。下一步怎么走？\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11176:- **Decided (Alex):** one bounded repair of judging-v13's request and checks, per council round 48 (D733).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11180:  - A clean result goes back to Alex as a request to re-send the same 36 requests under a new decision, with D725's lines\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
