:36:14.896 xcodebuild[12015:73465829] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n M docs/CURRENT_STATE.md\n M docs/DECISIONS-log.md\n M docs/DECISIONS.md\n?? docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
